# Anchored to the repo root: an unanchored `data/` ignores a `data` directory
# at ANY depth (e.g. a future src/data/ or test/fixtures/data/), silently
# dropping it from commits. Non-default --store roots must live under an
# ignored path too — see CLAUDE.md "Running it".
/data/

# build harness (config + ledger are committed, runtime state is not)
.harness/*
!.harness/config.json
!.harness/README.md
!.harness/decisions.md
